[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0399","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0399.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1278","title":"Zope Web 应用服务器安全绕过漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.4 及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞，其 DTML 模板引擎中的 dtml-var 标签 fmt 属性可被部分可信用户利用，通过访问该属性绕过安全控制并调用原本受限的方法。攻击者需具备一定权限以注入或修改 DTML 模板，进而执行未授权操作。该漏洞影响基于 Zope 框架构建的 Web 应用，可能导致敏感数据泄露或权限提升。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1278"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:57.237","remediation":"升级到 Zope 2.2.4 或更高版本，该版本已修复 dtml-var 标签 fmt 属性导致的权限绕过问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Zope 配置中禁用 dtml-var 标签的 fmt 属性访问，或通过反向代理限制对受影响方法的访问，仅允许完全受信任的用户调用相关方法。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-080.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-115.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3425","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1278.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1278","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1278.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e90b2f048f8d5dc2c03ffbfc9a042a055738ffe6/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1278.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mf74-w5x5-fpfg/GHSA-mf74-w5x5-fpfg.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1278.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-1278.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1278.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--52ca8790-4271-47ce-8815-8042be6ac5a7.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0399.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0376","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0376.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1227","title":"Zope Zope 安全控制绕过漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.4 及之前版本存在安全控制绕过漏洞，部分受信任用户可通过 dtml-var 标签的 fmt 属性访问受保护的方法，绕过安全控制机制。该漏洞影响 Zope 2.2.4 之前的所有版本，攻击者需具备部分受信任用户权限，通过构造特定的 dtml-var 标签并利用 fmt 属性调用受限方法，从而绕过安全控制访问受限资源或执行未授权操作。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH），影响机密性、完整性和可用性，Zope 官方已在 2.2.4 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1227"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-10T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:51.040","remediation":"升级Zope到最新稳定版本（如3.0.x或以上），并修改dtml-var配置中禁用fmt属性访问；设置web应用防火墙规则，严格限制对dtml标签的访问权限；实施强制认证和权限控制，阻止部分可信用户执行安全绕过操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-080.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-072.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-115.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3425","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7271","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1227.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1227","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1227.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1227.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fp27-q2r7-f723/GHSA-fp27-q2r7-f723.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1227.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1227.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1227.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d21a6470-b1f0-47b8-a497-f929c7c85fab.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0376.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0370","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0370.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1147","title":"util-linux /bin/login PAM 实现密码凭证泄露漏洞","description":"util-linux 包 2.11 之前版本中 /bin/login 的 PAM 实现存在密码条目重写漏洞。当使用 pam_limits 等特定 PAM 模块时，多次 PAM 调用之间密码条目可能被错误重写，导致一个用户的凭证泄露给另一个用户。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞获取其他用户的登录凭据，从而提升权限至受影响账户级别。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限并触发特定 PAM 调用序列，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1147"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-08T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:40.643","remediation":"升级 util-linux 软件包至 2.11 及以上版本。Red Hat Linux 用户应安装 RHSA-2001:132 提供的更新包（util-linux-2.11-2.i386.rpm），Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2001:084 对应更新。旧版 /bin/login 的 PAM 实现在连续调用 PAM 模块（如 pam_limits）时会错误复用前一次认证的密码凭据，升级后可消除此跨用户凭据泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/m-009.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/7266.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-084.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_034_shadow_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-132.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/219175","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3415","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d056d8ae56f5d770f04fc59fa77c6fef447db4a1/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1147.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1147","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1147.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d927d63ee32587ef80d9e763226701b1dc32c67d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1147.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hc7f-gvfc-9wwx/GHSA-hc7f-gvfc-9wwx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1147.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-084.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--73c21556-9024-40f8-b62b-508e1e78fa73.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1147.json","https://github.com/dmc5179/rhsa-tools/blob/677b19c223fe2771414f7b2fc89b4a4f39d25719/cvrfs/RHSA-2001:132.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0370.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0301","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0301.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0670","title":"多种 BSD 操作系统 lpd 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"多种 BSD 系操作系统的行打印守护进程（lpd/in.lpd）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含过长文件名的未完成打印作业，随后请求显示打印队列触发内存溢出，进而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 FreeBSD 4.3 及更早版本、NetBSD 1.5.1 及更早版本、OpenBSD 2.9 及更早版本、BSD/OS 4.1 及更早版本等多个发行版，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者只需在网络可达目标主机的 TCP/515 端口即可发起利用，无需任何凭据。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0670"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-10-03T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:43.487","remediation":"升级受影响系统到最新补丁版本：NetBSD 升级至 1.5 分支 2001-09-30 后的版本并重新编译安装 /usr/sbin/lpd；OpenBSD 升级至 2.9 或应用 2.8 errata 032 补丁；FreeBSD 升级至 4.2 以后的稳定版本。如暂时无法升级，若不需打印服务应立即停止 lpd 进程，并通过 /etc/hosts.lpd 限制仅允许可信主机访问，禁止任意来源连接 515 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-30.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/274043","http://www.openbsd.com/errata28.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-147.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3252","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise94.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7046","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3a2f85f8ac60847cbc2b69c575be49a8e5667923/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0670.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0670","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/80b9e46bc035d31d1e13fdb38c5f781e8a013488/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0670.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3249236c34411e31ff9cfd40b20136dbc5077a03/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0670.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/25ad427cb260813264acc83dfac643f53a339579/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-v42x-vp33-82v3/GHSA-v42x-vp33-82v3.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/lpd_bsd_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0670.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--00518187-019d-4f93-8e63-4392f36ce23c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0301.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0308","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0731","title":"Apache HTTP Server 目录索引信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 1.3.20 在启用 Multiviews 选项时存在目录索引信息泄露漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送包含 \"M=D\" 查询字符串的 URL 请求，绕过默认索引页面直接获取目录列表内容，导致服务器目录结构和文件信息泄露。该漏洞影响启用 Multiviews 选项的 Apache 1.3.20 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，攻击复杂度低，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），主要影响机密性。攻击者只需构造包含 \"M=D\" 参数的 HTTP 请求即可绕过索引页面直接列出目录内容，获取敏感文件列表信息。Apache 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至修复版本或禁用 Multiviews 选项。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0731"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-01T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:51.233","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 1.3.21 或更高版本（已修复该漏洞）。若暂时无法升级，请在 httpd.conf 中将 Options Indexes FollowSymLinks MultiViews 修改为 Options FollowSymLinks（移除 Indexes 和 MultiViews），或在目录级配置添加 <Directory /> Options -Indexes -MultiViews </Directory> 禁用目录索引与多视图功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2001:077","http://www.apacheweek.com/issues/01-10-05#security","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-126.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-164.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/20010709214744.A28765%40brasscannon.net","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3009","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8275","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5419c9ba0951ef73a655362403d12bb8d10fab38274deb3f005816f5%40%3Ccvs.httpd.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/threa