2001-0109","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1034","title":"HylaFAX faxrm/faxalter 格式字符串本地代码执行漏洞","description":"Hylafax 传真软件在 FreeBSD 系统上存在格式化字符串漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 faxrm 或 faxalter 命令的 -h hostname 参数中传入特制的格式化字符串标识符，触发格式化字符串漏洞，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行 Hylafax 的 FreeBSD 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议用户升级到已修复版本或限制本地用户对受影响命令的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1034"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2001-09-23T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:27.187","remediation":"升级 Hylafax 到 4.1.1 及以上版本，该版本已修复 faxrm 和 faxalter 中 -h 参数的格式化字符串问题。FreeBSD 用户可通过 ports 更新：`portsupgrade print/hylafax` 或重新编译安装。Debian 用户升级至 1:4.1.1-1.1（对应 DSA-148）。如无法立即升级，应限制本地不可信用户对 faxrm 和 faxalter 命令的执行权限，仅允许受信任的管理员使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/215984","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3357","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7164","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1034","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-1034.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1034.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g7gq-5686-jw88/GHSA-g7gq-5686-jw88.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/mandrake_MDKSA-2002-055.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-148.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1034.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b0d891c6-0102-4c75-8987-941f621d9814.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0312","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0706","title":"Maximum Rumpus FTP Server 堆栈溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Maxum Rumpus FTP Server 1.3.x 及 2.0.3 开发版及更早版本存在栈溢出拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过发送包含大量子目录参数的 MKD/MKDIR 命令触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致 FTP 服务进程崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞属于本地/相邻网络攻击（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需认证（Au:N），仅影响可用性（A:P），CVSS 2.1 评为低危。影响范围为运行受影响版本 Rumpus FTP Server 的服务器，攻击者需具备本地或相邻网络访问权限且拥有创建目录权限即可利用。建议升级至 2.0.4 或更高版本修复。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0706"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48.430","remediation":"建议立即升级 Maxum Rumpus FTP Server 至 2.0.4 或更高版本（官网 maxum.com 提供更新）。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙层面限制 FTP 服务仅对受信 IP 开放，并禁用匿名 mkdir 权限作为临时缓解措施。建议同时监控 FTP 日志中异常 mkdir 请求，及时阻断异常 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/190932","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2864","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6699","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20922","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0706.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0706","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0706.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0706.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cccc-x5r4-7h2q/GHSA-cccc-x5r4-7h2q.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0706.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0706.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ea146eae-b320-4f7e-b3f5-4c0706ced76a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0312.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0309","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0705","title":"1C Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 任意文件泄露漏洞","description":"1C: Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 存在目录遍历漏洞。当攻击者向 Web 服务器发送包含 \"dot dot\" 序列的模板参数 URL 时，应用程序的 tradecli.dll 文件未能正确验证用户输入，导致攻击者能够访问 Web 服务器上的任意文件。这种漏洞影响 Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 版本，是一个经典的 Web 应用安全缺陷。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程执行攻击，通过精心构造的 URL 访问敏感文件，如系统配置文件、数据库连接字符串甚至是操作系统密码表等，威胁到整个服务器的安全。由于该漏洞仅影响信息的机密性，没有直接影响信息的完整性和可用性，因此 CVSS 评分仅为 5.0，反映出其属于低危信息泄露类漏洞，已经成为 Web 安全中的常见问题，该问题一直持续到如今都未能完全得到有效解决。(54字)","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0705"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48.327","remediation":"建议升级至 1C: Arcadia Internet Store 2.0 或更高版本（厂商已停止 1.0 版本支持）。若无法升级，建议在 Web 服务器层面配置 WAF 规则拦截包含 `../`、`..\\\\` 等目录遍历序列的请求，同时限制 Web 服务器进程对敏感目录的读取权限，并在防火墙层面限制对 tradecli.dll 接口的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2902","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6737","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20947","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6871b34457c95f7cba228f12a5ad62036a72e749/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0705.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0705","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0705.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0705.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2x3x-ch63-vcqp/GHSA-2x3x-ch63-vcqp.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2902/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0705.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0307","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0307.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0704","title":"1C Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 路径泄露漏洞","description":"1C: Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 的 tradecli.dll 组件存在路径泄露漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过构造包含不存在文件模板参数的 URL 请求，导致应用程序在错误响应中泄露服务器工作目录的完整物理路径。该漏洞影响 1C: Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可获取服务器目录结构信息，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），属于信息泄露类漏洞，攻击者可利用泄露的路径信息进一步发起路径遍历、文件包含等后续攻击。官方已停止维护该版本，建议升级至新版本或迁移至现代电商平台。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0704"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48.217","remediation":"升级到最新的 1C:Enterprise 平台版本，应用最新的安全补丁并更新 tradecli.dll。修改 web 服务器配置，禁用模板参数功能或实现严格的错误处理以防止路径信息泄露。如无法立即更新，可在防火墙中添加规则以拒绝对 tradecli.dll 的访问请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2904","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6738","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20948","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/20ad1fe1013ca96ea2384f289b4316baeb76e2fc/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0704.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0704","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0704.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/88dff62b57cbb639f2b0714fb489ef14e49d5b06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0704.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2pcg-p7wq-33j6/GHSA-2pcg-p7wq-33j6.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2904/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0704.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0307.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0305","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0305.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0703","title":"1C Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"1C: Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 的 tradecli.dll 组件在处理模板参数时未正确验证 MS-DOS 设备名称（如 COM1、PRN、AUX 等），远程未认证攻击者可构造包含 MS-DOS 设备名称的 URL 请求，导致服务器进程挂起或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Arcadia Internet Store 1.0 版本，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，仅影响可用性（CVSS 5.0，AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P）。攻击者只需发送包含类似 COM1、PRN 等设备名的模板参数即可触发拒绝服务，ExploitDB 已公开 PoC（EDB-20949）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0703"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48.097","remediation":"建议立即升级至 1C: Arcadia Internet Store 2.0 或更高版本（官方已停止 1.0 版本支持）。若无法升级，建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截包含 MS-DOS 设备名（如 COM1、LPT1、AUX、PRN、NUL、CON）的 template 参数请求，或在 Web 服务器层面配置 URL 重写规则拦截包含设备名的模板参数请求，同时建议迁移至现代电商平台替代该已停止维护的旧版本产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2905","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6739","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20949","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1f2f850a48475dab7b1e1b1c322080edeefb8fa2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0703.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0703","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0703.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/98bfa0c64da76a68ffd6d214f436c90f142d4964/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0703.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7mqh-m7g2-m4gv/GHSA-7mqh-m7g2-m4gv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0703.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5be40f9b-b6e0-4aaf-85cd-13999c1b559d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0305.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0304","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0304.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0691","title":"华盛顿大学 imapd 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Washington University 开发的 imapd（互联网消息访问协议守护进程）2000a 至 2000c 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞源于程序在处理某些输入时未对缓冲区长度进行充分边界检查，导致栈上或堆上的缓冲区可被溢写覆盖。在特定配置下，攻击者作为拥有本地账号但无 shell 访问权限的普通用户，可利用此漏洞在 imapd 进程中执行任意代码，并以自身用户身份获得部分代码执行权限。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本 imapd 的各类 Linux/Unix 服务器，CVSS 评分为 4.6（中危），攻击复杂度低，无需额外认证即可触发。成功利用可导致攻击者在服务器上获得进一步的控制能力，建议升级至补丁版本或更高稳定版本以消除安全隐患。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0691"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:46.733","remediation":"建议立即将 Washington University imapd 升级至 2000d 或更高版本，以修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。Red Hat 系统可安装 RHSA-2001:094 安全更新，Mandrake 系统可应用 MDKSA-2001:054 补丁。如暂时无法升级，建议在防火墙中限制 IMAP 服务的本地访问，仅允许可信用户连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6269.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-094.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3352","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2856","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e532da319bd448554f3195f38b855d2e9be0809/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0691.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0691","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0691.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c38da4de9997eed21b6a4c71c4b194b6f142b8fc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0691.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34d23bc289ec08cf13b2c7e74563dcd9a8c17e9/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7vqj-q42p-29c8/GHSA-7vqj-q42p-29c8.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0691.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2856/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0691.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6064aaa6-3f6b-44f2-8f4e-a920d391a4b6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0304.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0303","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0303.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0702","title":"Cerberus FTP Server 1.x 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cerberus FTP Server 1.5 及更早版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 FTP 协议向目标服务器发送超长的用户名、密码或 PASV 命令触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，可能引发拒绝服务甚至远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Cerberus FTP Server 1.x 系列早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需任何身份验证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0702"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:47.977","remediation":"建议将 Cerberus FTP Server 升级至厂商最新发布的 2026.x 版本（当前稳定版为 2026.2.2），该版本已修复历史上包括 CVE-2001-0702 在内的所有已知缓冲区溢出漏洞。若运行环境受限于旧版系统无法立即升级，应在边界防火墙或主机防火墙中仅允许可信 IP 段访问 21/TCP 端口，并临时禁用匿名登录；同时在入侵检测系统（IDS）中部署规则，对 FTP 用户名、密码及 PASV 命令携带超过 300 字节超长字符串的连接会话进行拦截告警。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archive.cert.uni-stuttgart.de/archive/bugtraq/2001/07/msg00070.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192655","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2901","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6728","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20946","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b4a89b44478cf1ae516da29bd6f16b00a8bec011/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0702.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0702","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8ebd6486a02ca9f434893ea11941a54d5b5dfa32/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0702.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d2521a6a6a6b95fdd6c2651e419302899bbee89/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0702.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/99cae226d61b8e74336dc0c5e362f6c067c34ab5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vwm4-vhxv-9c48/GHSA-vwm4-vhxv-9c48.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0702.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2901/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--387ec1e3-9fdc-436f-b41b-ce57c4ce78fd.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0303.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0302","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0302.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0701","title":"Sun SunVTS PTExec 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Microsystems 开发的 Sun Validation Test Suite（SunVTS）4.3 及更早版本中，ptexec 工具在处理 -o 命令行参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该程序未对用户传入的参数长度进行充分的边界检查，攻击者可构造超长字符串作为 -o 参数的值，覆盖栈上的返回地址，从而劫持程序执行流程。该漏洞仅影响具备本地访问权限的用户，攻击者需首先登录到运行 SunVTS 的 Solaris 系统，然后执行 /opt/SUNWvts/bin/ptexec -o 并附带超长载荷即可触发溢出，实现权限提升并可能获得系统的完全管理控制权。Sun Microsystems 已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0701"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:47.867","remediation":"建议升级 SunVTS 至 5.0 或更高版本，或应用 Sun 安全补丁 112617-01。如暂无法升级，临时措施为将 /opt/SUNWvts/bin/ptexec 权限修改为仅 root 用户可执行（chmod 700），并限制普通用户对 SunVTS 的访问，以消除本地用户利用该缓冲区溢出提权的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192667","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2898","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6736","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20945","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3a2f85f8ac60847cbc2b69c575be49a8e5667923/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0701.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0701","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/80b9e46bc035d31d1e13fdb38c5f781e8a013488/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0701.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3249236c34411e31ff9cfd40b20136dbc5077a03/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0701.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/25ad427cb260813264acc83dfac643f53a339579/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3chf-9q2g-qc3v/GHSA-3chf-9q2g-qc3v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0701.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7144cb01-a4af-47a3-acb4-f8f9a33bdce5.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0701.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0302.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0300","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0700","title":"W3M 0.2.1 及更早版本 MIME 报文头缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags.<value>W3M 是一个流行的命令行网页浏览器，其 0.2.1 及更早版本在处理 MIME 邮件头时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当远程攻击者向使用 W3M 的目标发送包含超长 base64 编码 MIME 头的恶意邮件或网页内容时，W3M 解析该头字段时发生缓冲区溢出，可能导致执行任意代码。此漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 W3M 的系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可在远程发起利用，造成权限提升、信息泄露或系统被完全控制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0700"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:47.737","remediation":"立即将 w3m 升级至 0.2.2 或更高版本以修复 MIME 头 base64 缓冲区溢出。Debian 用户应执行 apt-get update && apt-get install w3m 以获取 DSA-064/DSA-081 补丁版本，FreeBSD 用户应安装 FreeBSD-SA-01:46.w3m 安全补丁。如无法立即升级，应临时避免使用 w3m 访问不可信或未知网站，因恶意远程服务器可通过构造超长 base64 编码 MIME 头字段触发缓冲区溢出并执行任意代码，可通过先使用 curl 等工具下载网页再本地查看代替直接使用 w3m 浏览外部内容作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000434","http://mi.med.tohoku.ac.jp/~satodai/w3m-dev-en/200106.month/537.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-064","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-081","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192371","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2895","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6725","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20941","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fe1f2cb931ec10d1e039a6fd54386a966f969658/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0700.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0700","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0700.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e42471f11b569c31aa66236a559376c1c33d96f2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0700.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-064.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a1f79da7d9ace94965a4a6372e679be3d02ffe25/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w4h5-5xwp-3m26/GHSA-w4h5-5xwp-3m26.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-081.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--190adffa-b1c7-453f-bfc0-522364d6a31b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0299","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0299.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0697","title":"Netwin SurgeFTP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetWin SurgeFTP 1.0b 至 1.1h 之间存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的 \"ls ..\" 命令触发目标 FTP 服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 SurgeFTP 1.0b、1.0c、1.0d、1.0e、1.0f、1.0g、1.0h 及 1.1g 等版本，攻击者只需建立 FTP 连接并发送目录列表命令即可导致服务器异常终止，造成服务中断。由于攻击通过网络发起且无需任何用户交互，任何可访问 SurgeFTP 服务的远程用户均可利用此漏洞实施拒绝服务攻击。攻击成功后将导致 FTP 进程崩溃或重启，影响正常文件传输业务。建议升级到 SurgeFTP 1.1h 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0697"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-09-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:47.403","remediation":"标签中。<value>立即将 NetWin SurgeFTP 升级至 1.1h 或更高版本，此版本已修复通过 'ls ..' 命令引发崩溃的漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议通过防火墙或访问控制列表限制外部对 FTP 端口的访问，或在服务器端临时屏蔽 LIST 命令对父目录的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://netwinsite.com/surgeftp/manual/updates.htm","http://www.secadministrator.com/Articles/Index.cfm?ArticleID=20200","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/165816","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2442","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6168","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20659","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/721f5647080ad234b0e7db49f4cb7a1a1f72d604/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0697.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0697","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0697.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ffd57c03ae1089460fd6f5c8a0b1d7efb29040a8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0697.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/39d8887723797efc1804585dd06585c9fd751226/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vqw8-7vgj-vq9c/GHSA-vqw8-7vgj-vq9c.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151500_151600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c273d018-01a6-49bc-aa2f-b90a66e1ae76.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f386368